  "text_objects": [
    {
      "text": "A  模型组成与分支评分",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "text": "输入图像 x\n1 × 19 × 19 灰度，[0,1]",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 17.0
    },
    {
      "text": "小网络输入 A_S(x)\n逐图标准化与裁剪",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 16.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Dense 输入 A_D(x)\n128×128、三通道、ImageNet 归一化",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.5
    },
    {
      "text": "共享冻结前缀 E\nz = E(A_D(x))：512 × 4 × 4",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 16.0
    },
    {
      "text": "N5：共享 norm5 参数\n四条分支各自计算激活",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.5
    },
    {
      "text": "每图只计算一次 E，按图像 ID 复用 z",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 16.0
    },
    {
      "text": "所有 R/H 成员接收 A_S(x)；每条 Dense 尾接收同一 z。",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "共享特征 z",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "保护分支 B · 7 成员",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 18.0
    },
    {
      "text": "ResNet8 × 3（42 / 7 / 2026）\n成员 σ 后概率平均 → p_BR",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "HiRes19 × 3（42 / 7 / 2026）\n成员 σ 后概率平均 → p_BH",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Dense 尾：block4_B → N5 → ReLU\n→ GAP → head_B → σ → p_BD",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 13.7
    },
    {
      "text": "三家族等权概率均值\np_B = (p_BR + p_BH + p_BD) / 3\nv_B = 1[p_B ≥ 0.37]",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.7
    },
    {
      "text": "三个家族先各自产生一个分数",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 13.5
    },
    {
      "text": "救援分支 1 · 7 成员",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 18.0
    },
    {
      "text": "ResNet8 × 3（42 / 7 / 2026）\n成员 σ 后概率平均 → p_1R",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "HiRes19 × 3（42 / 7 / 2026）\n成员 σ 后概率平均 → p_1H",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Dense 尾：block4_1 → N5 → ReLU\n→ GAP → head_1 → σ → p_1D",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 13.7
    },
    {
      "text": "家族分数 → 受限 logit L_1\nh_1 = w_1 · L_1 + γ_1\nv_1 = 1[h_1 ≥ 0]",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.7
    },
    {
      "text": "三个家族先各自产生一个分数",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 13.5
    },
    {
      "text": "救援分支 2 · 7 成员",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 18.0
    },
    {
      "text": "ResNet8 × 3（42 / 7 / 2026）\n成员 σ 后概率平均 → p_2R",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "HiRes19 × 3（42 / 7 / 2026）\n成员 σ 后概率平均 → p_2H",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Dense 尾：block4_2 → N5 → ReLU\n→ GAP → head_2 → σ → p_2D",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 13.7
    },
    {
      "text": "家族分数 → 受限 logit L_2\nh_2 = w_2 · L_2 + γ_2\nv_2 = 1[h_2 ≥ 0]",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.7
    },
    {
      "text": "三个家族先各自产生一个分数",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 13.5
    },
    {
      "text": "救援分支 3 · 7 成员",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 18.0
    },
    {
      "text": "ResNet8 × 3（42 / 7 / 2026）\n成员 σ 后概率平均 → p_3R",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "HiRes19 × 3（42 / 7 / 2026）\n成员 σ 后概率平均 → p_3H",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Dense 尾：block4_3 → N5 → ReLU\n→ GAP → head_3 → σ → p_3D",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 13.7
    },
    {
      "text": "家族分数 → 受限 logit L_3\nh_3 = w_3 · L_3 + γ_3\nv_3 = 1[h_3 ≥ 0]",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 14.7
    },
    {
      "text": "三个家族先各自产生一个分数",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 13.5
    },
    {
      "text": "四个 block4 / head 分别训练；N5 参数共享不等于分支激活共享。救援 w 与 γ 为部署固定参数。",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "B  逐图条件执行：只计算影响当前决策的分支",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "text": "执行保护分支\n计算并缓存 z，得到 p_B",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.5
    },
    {
      "text": "p_B ≥ 0.37？",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 16.0
    },
    {
      "text": "返回：人脸（+1）",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.5
    },
    {
      "text": "是",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "只对保护分支负例\n计算救援投票 v_1、v_2",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.5
    },
    {
      "text": "否",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "v_1 = v_2？",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 16.0
    },
    {
      "text": "返回两者共同的投票",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.5
    },
    {
      "text": "是",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "两票分歧：计算 v_3\n复用 z，只执行第 3 救援分支",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "否",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "返回 v_3 对应类别\n等价于三组投票至少 2 票为正",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "最终规则：",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 17.0
    },
    {
      "text": "v_B = 1 或 v_1 + v_2 + v_3 ≥ 2 → 人脸",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 17.0
    },
    {
      "text": "其他情况 → 非人脸",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 17.0
    },
    {
      "text": "投票 1 对应人脸（+1）；投票 0 对应非人脸（−1）。σ 仅用于成员概率，救援融合直接比较线性边际。",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 15.0
    },
    {
      "text": "S01 最终模型：共享特征、四路判别与条件执行",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei-Bold.ttc",
      "point_size": 27.0
    },
    {
      "text": "28 个分类成员 ＝ 24 个小网络 ＋ 4 个 Dense 分类成员；神经参数 15,294,620",
      "font_file": "${ORIGINAL_HOME}/Library/Fonts/MedicalMVP-MicrosoftYaHei.ttc",
      "point_size": 17.0
    }
